True when every Replicated property on `desc` is of a replicable type;
`outOffender` receives the first violating property's name. Run once
when a descriptor is cached.

Invoked before property deserialization when the node's stored version
is below `version`. It must rename / move / synthesise properties so
the standard deserialization path finds the new schema; chain through
every version that introduced a change.
if (from < 2) { rename "color" → "tintColor"; from = 2; }
if (from < 3) { split "size" Vec2 → "sizeX","sizeY"; from = 3; }
